 who not only looks a lot like Kuroneko, but is named Kurohaneko!","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.9}],"value":6.9,"age":"R"},"background_color":"#dbdbdb","current_season_id":10424,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}